message: "Our suite evolves to maintain its relevance. It is therefore essential that you cite the version number associated with the release in any use of the benchmark using the associated DOI, and as a courtesy to the developers, we ask that you please cite the paper from ASPLOS 2025 describing the Chopin suite."
